  "body": "Beautifully positioned in the centre of the beach with your lawn and gate opening onto the sand and Rangitoto the focal point of your view.  This home offers wonderful potential for those wishing to secure a prime beachfront position and the enviable Cheltenham lifestyle. \r\n\r\nThe existing home comprises of two independent homes joined, making one large residence. Each area provides independent living with its own kitchen, bathroom and living areas. This floorplan would renovate easily into one larger home, a home and granny-flat or a home and income. It is currently perfect for multi-generational living and offers tidy and comfortable living as is, but with dated interiors it is ideal for those wishing to add their personal style with a full renovation or possibly to remove and rebuild. \r\n\r\nMid-century charm is evident throughout, and the living is positioned with excellent flow to the large, covered deck and incredible views. Voluminous open spaces on the ground level have been whitewashed and utilised as an “art studio” and rumpus, this area opens out to the garden for easy beach access and is perfect for additional bedrooms or living. \r\n\r\nCheltenham is a world-class beachfront urban location offering a safe and charming beach, ample parks and recreation areas, cafes and excellent schools. The proximity to the village and the quick commute to the CBD via the ferry all add to the fabulous lifestyle. \r\nThis a rare opportunity for an affordable entry into one of Auckland’s favourite communities and popular golden sand beach.",
